You should model this as a regulator.

</pre>
      <blockquote type=3D"cite">
        <pre wrap=3D"">+ - num-eps : Specifies the number of endpoints. T=
his is also a
+     MUSB configuration-specific setting.
</pre>
      </blockquote>
