</pre>
      <blockquote type=3D"cite">
        <pre wrap=3D"">+
+ - multipoint : Should be "1" indicating the musb controller supports
+     multipoint. This is a MUSB configuration-specific setting.
</pre>
      </blockquote>
      <pre wrap=3D"">
